    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay so basically you're saying the biological arguments are just objectively more valid. but wouldn't someone on the other side argue that inclusion is a human right and more important than any physical advantage? how would you actually respond to that? is there even a way to balance it or is it just a losing battle for women's sports?",
